  "description": "If you're ready to hit the town in style for a weekend ride then this bike for two is right for you. Cruising bike paths and boulevards is a pleasure on this retro styled tandem. Comfort is the goal here and this tandem is available in two versions to suit a variety of riding needs.\nHeavy duty high-tensile steel frame with step-thru rear stoker position\nAlloy cranksets with sealed cartridge bottom brackets\nAlloy rims with stainless steel spokes\n26\" x 2.125\" cruiser tires\nComfort Cruiser mid-rise steel handlebar up front and high rise handlebar in the back\nHigh rise alloy stem up front and adjustable reach stem in the back\nSun comfort cruiser saddles and foam grips\nSteel chain guard and fenders\nAlloy kickstand",
